            "review_title": "Review at Thiet 168",
            "review_text": "Tony V\n4 contributions\n0\nGood food but they tried to scam us twice....\nJul 2019 • Couples\nRestaurant was busy and the food was tasty. Prices are reasonable but we ordered a pigeon dish which had barely any meat on the bones so avoid. Our order was forgotten and we had to remind the waitress on several occasions but did eventually receive all of our food.\n\nWhen we went to pay there were extra items on the bill so beware. We were also given 50k change instead of 150k. they corrected this but I can't help but think it was on purpose.\n\nTL:DR good food but check your bill and don't be shy to ask about your food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 2, 2019",
