            "review_text": "PlaneChica\nLondon, United Kingdom193 contributions\n0\nGood food, very busy and food comes out one dish at a time\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nPros\n- Food was very tasty and cooked fresh \n\n- There is an English menu with all meals fully described.\n\n- Full sized tables and seating rather than little chairs if that is the kind of restaurant that you're looking for\n\n- Good price. Around 80k for a main dish and then 15k for rice (can be shared between two) and drinks are approx 12k. \n\n- There are a good range of beers to pick from\n\nCons\n- The food comes out one dish at a time. This meant that there was around half an hour between our first and last dish. I also had around 10-15mins with just sauteed squid and no rice\nRead more\nWritten February 23, 2019",
