            "review_title": "Review at Thiet 168",
            "review_text": "Normunds\nRiga, Latvia21 contributions\n0\nGreat local food for cheap\nDec 2018 • Solo\nIt's a simple local restaurant, yet with surprisingly good quality food, and lots of choices. And the price is really cheap (you can stuff yourself like a king with multiple beers for like 7$).\n\nAte here twice, didn't experience none of the scammy practices from other reviews. I would guess times are changing.\n\nDefinitely go for the specialty hot-pot.\n\nThe place can be loud, wide drunk local people, but that is a part of the authentic experience in my view.\nRead more\nWritten December 20, 2018",
