            "review_title": "Review at Thiet 168",
            "review_text": "Merevaik\nEngland750 contributions\n1\nGood local food at reasonable price\nNov 2018 • Couples\nWe were the only foreign people in this restaurant and as it was completely full of Vietnamese family groups. It is certainly liked by local Vietnamese families. Most menus are in Vietnamese but a very helpful server produced two English language menus. This was great and let us get started.\n\nWe had a mixture of things as shown on the attached bill. All was of a good standard and we enjoyed all our food. The \"steam boat\" was great fun and I recommend you try this. Saigon Red is only 10,000 VND and I struggled to buy at this price in local supermarkets.\n\nAs we enjoyed our meal we returned the next day. Again the meal was very good and we enjoyed this especially as we knew how to order ! The portions are very big and ideal for sharing. We also had Vietnamese coffee this time and we both liked it.\n\nIn summary, a good quality local restaurant with no pretensions to be anything else. The food is very well priced and of a good standard.\n\nWe will return next time we visit Da lat.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten November 17, 2018",
