            "review_text": "lchilcoat2000\nDa Lat, Vietnam674 contributions\n0\nVery good restaurant with many local dishes\nOct 2018 • Solo\nThis restaurant has a huge selection of local foods and really has good food at very reasonable prices \n\nAs example had the steamed shrimp with Rice , which the dish came with 10 medium sized shrimp plus generous rice and 2 tiger beers 125,000 dong or equivalent to $ 5.39 USD. \n\nExcellent meal with excellent service and English speaking wait staff and an English menu offering. \n\nThumbs up for a very good local restaurant offering many dishes to choose from. \n\nFrom pizza to steaks to pigeon to venison.\nRead more\nWritten October 21, 2018",
