            "review_text": "Ben Shanahan\nAshurst Wood45 contributions\n0\nIncredibly good local food\nAug 2018 • Couples\nIf you are looking for cheap and outstanding local food, this is the place to visit. It is definitely a local’s restaurant so don’t expect a fancy interior, no smoking or a quiet atmosphere. The food, however, is outstanding and very well priced. We had the lemongrass grilled chicken (melt in your mouth good) and some stir fried veg with beef, both of which far exceeded our expectations. With some onion rings (I was having cravings) and two beers the bill came to d170,000. It is possible to eat here for half that though.\nRead more\nWritten August 8, 2018",
